{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Void Corridors</strong> is a first-person puzzle horror game where you navigate maze-like environments, solve intricate puzzles, and manage limited resources to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for energy to keep your flashlight powered and maintain the generator that lights the corridors. Every second of illumination matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Tackle a variety of environmental puzzles to unlock new areas, uncover hidden secrets, and descend deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Traverse dark, shifting hallways filled with an eerie glow. Stay vigilant\u2014at times, it may feel as if the walls themselves are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 The deeper you go, the stronger the sense of being observed becomes. Unravel the mystery behind the corridors before the presence lurking in the shadows finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth\u2026 or become lost in the void?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No More Fear?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/27669b0a674217efd55b64fe4b9e98efe6e8f51d.jpg"},{"name":"Mine to Find","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/d566a5e22679803fb79bc539c454056c5848588f.jpg"},{"name":"Begin the Hunt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/f6713095b24ced3d71fd8bbb62eaf71b0a2822e6.jpg"},{"name":"You Shouldn\u2019t Be Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/5f11654d25c263b528f087d87ddca5ede3f15cc7.jpg"},{"